# Teysa Karlov: "If a creature dying causes a triggered ability of a permanent you control to trigger, that ability
# triggers an additional time" (CR 603.2d). The ability may be the dying creature's own "when this creature dies",
# judged as it last existed (CR 603.10a; the rulings: "Teysa affects a creature's own 'when this creature dies'
# triggered abilities"). On turn 3 Bot1 sacrifices its Haywire Mite to its own ability, exiling Bot2's Mox Sapphire: "When
# this creature dies, you gain 2 life" triggers twice, 24 life. Then Bot1 Lightning Bolts Bot2's Haywire Mite: its ability
# is Bot2's, and Bot2 gains 2 only.

